  "extra_html": "<style>\n.eval-table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }\n.eval-table th, .eval-table td { border: 1px solid #d1d5db; padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }\n.eval-table th { background: #f3f4f6; }\n.asset-grid, .viz-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin: 1rem 0 2rem; }\n.asset-card, .viz-card { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; background: #fff; }\n.asset-card img, .viz-card img, .viz-card video { display: block; width: 100%; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 6px; background: #000; margin-top: 8px; }\n.viz-card h4 { margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n.viz-card p { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #4b5563; word-break: break-word; }\n.note { color: #4b5563; }\n</style>\n<section>\n  <h2>Static RoPE MANO-Only Eval</h2>\n  <p>This eval intentionally uses the existing static-RoPE checkpoint at <code>1077137</code> and only restores MANO heads. Direct auxiliary heads are not evaluated because that checkpoint did not save <code>direct_*</code> modules.</p>\n  <table class=\"eval-table\">\n    <thead><tr><th>Split</th><th>n seq/cam</th><th>Oracle MANO joint L2</th><th>Detected MANO joint L2</th><th>Oracle mesh L2</th><th>Detected mesh L2</th><th>Detection F1</th><th>Side acc</th><th>Obj trans</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>train30</td><td>30</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>test30</td><td>30</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td><td>n/a</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</section>\n<section>\n  <h2>Loss Curves</h2>\n  <div class=\"asset-grid\">\n    <div class=\"asset-card\"><h4>Total / slot losses</h4><img src=\"2026-05-09-session-summary-dt10-static-rope-mano-heads-eval/loss_curves/loss_curves_total_slot.png\" alt=\"Total and slot loss curves\" loa